着它的动作，一团团光雾从它手掌间冒出，翻涌扩散。镜头缓缓推近，捕捉光雾里闪烁着如火山熔岩般的红光，大猩猩的面容威严且充满气势，背景是一片茂密的热带丛林，湿热的风拂动它的毛发。\n镜头 2：俯拍镜头，光雾升腾而上，汇聚成一个巨大的光团，与雨林上方的氤氲水汽交融。镜头缓缓拉远，大猩猩蹲立于丛林空地中央，双臂有力地指挥着光雾的翻涌。力量与神秘完美交织，展现它的霸气与掌控力。镜头转动，从俯拍切至侧面，捕捉它捶胸的威猛姿态，光影在它深色的毛发上跃动。\n镜头 3：慢镜头，镜头推进至光雾的翻涌轨迹，光线混合着丛林间透射的阳光，形成奇幻的光带。镜头平移，捕捉大猩猩的神情，眼中闪烁着威严的光芒。随着它最后一声低吼，光雾汇聚成一道粗壮的光柱直冲雨林上空，镜头顺着光柱向上推进，最终停在茂密树冠与光柱交织的画面，光辉为雨林镀上一层神秘色彩"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 152, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [181], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-175.22482299804688, 934.3192749023438], "widgets_values": [121], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "JWInteger", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JWInteger"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "文件名", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "size": [898.3994140625, 866.0996704101562], "pos": [1396.4107666015625, 808.884521484375], "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "AnimateDiff", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 19, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"filename": "AnimateDiff_00001_p80_tgpjl_1759905375.mp4", "workflow": "AnimateDiff_00001_p80.png", "fullpath": "/data/ComfyUI/personal/f8da1dce820ea358744198b349078de1/temp/AnimateDiff_00001_p80.mp4", "format": "video/h264-mp4", "subfolder": "", "type": "temp", "frame_rate": 16}}, "format": "video/h264-mp4", "no_preview": false, "frame_rate": 16, "pingpong": false}, "inpu